@startuml SEQ_07_KONFIRMASI_PASSWORD
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-07: Konfirmasi Password

actor       "Pengguna"                     as Pengguna
boundary    "Browser"                      as Browser
control     "ConfirmablePasswordController" as Controller
entity      "User Model"                   as Model

== Tampil Halaman Konfirmasi Password ==

Pengguna -> Browser    : Akses halaman yang memerlukan konfirmasi

Browser  -> Controller : GET /confirm-password
Controller --> Browser : Render form konfirmasi password
Browser  --> Pengguna  : Tampil form konfirmasi password

== Submit Konfirmasi Password ==

Pengguna -> Browser    : Masukkan password aktif, klik Konfirmasi

Browser  -> Controller : POST /confirm-password {password}

Controller -> Model    : validate({email, password})
Model --> Controller   : Berhasil
Controller --> Browser : Redirect ke halaman tujuan semula
Browser --> Pengguna   : Redirect ke halaman tujuan

@enduml